@startuml
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F5F5F5
  BorderColor #333333
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
hide empty description

title verification_token
[*] --> ISSUED : code or link sent
ISSUED --> USED : correct code entered / link opened
ISSUED --> EXPIRED : 10 min (code), 30 min (reset), 72 h (invitation)
ISSUED --> CANCELLED : 5th wrong code
ISSUED --> REPLACED : a new code or link is sent
USED --> [*]
EXPIRED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
REPLACED --> [*]
legend bottom
States are derived from used_at, expires_at and attempt_count; the table has no status column.
Dashed arrow: planned, not implemented yet.
endlegend
@enduml